# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This is a STUB repository. It carries documentation and screenshots only.
#
# The patterns below are a guard rail, not housekeeping: they exist so that an
# implementation cannot land here by accident. If you decide to publish a
# project's source, remove the relevant pattern deliberately rather than
# forcing past it with `git add -f`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ps1
*.psm1
*.psd1
*.py
*.sh
*.bat
*.cmd
*.c
*.cpp
*.cs
*.go
*.rs
*.rb
*.pl
*.exe
*.dll
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and test output, in case a project folder ever gains working files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.pfx
*.key
*.crt
results/
*.jsonl

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
